0,Likpe language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Likpe_language,Likpe or Sekpele is spoken in the mountainous lower part of the Oti Region of Ghana. It belongs to the geographic group of Ghana–Togo Mountain languages of the Kwa branch of Niger–Congo.,Sekpele,Niger-Congo
