4,Sekpele | Accent Network,https://accentnetwork.com/sekpele/,"Sekpele, also known as Likpe, is spoken by around 20,000 people in Ghana. It belongs to the Ghana-Togo Mountain language group, within the Niger-Congo family.Sekpele includes nasalized vowels and unique consonants, challenging for non-native speakers.",Sekpele,Niger-Congo
